# Agentic workflow

## Read order

1. Root `AGENTS.md` — kit workflow (Hermes, Kiro, rules)
2. `agents/AGENTS.md` — product swarm contract (when building MVP)
3. `ORCHESTRATOR.md` — current phase and sequencing
4. `DECISIONS.md` — past architectural decisions
5. `tasks/phase-*.md` — active implementation slice
6. `docs/` product specs; `docs/kit/` for Hermes/Kiro playbooks

## When finishing work, report

- Changed files (paths)
- Commands run + verification output
- Tests added or run
- Blockers
- Recommended next step

## Scope

- Do not edit attached plan files unless asked
- Do not push/deploy without approval
- Use `research/` only when explicitly researching; do not load huge research dumps by default
